>>__ load "simpExtLib";
>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `set_looper`

``` hol4
simpExtLib.set_looper : string * (simpExtLib.simpset -> tactic) ->
  simpExtLib.simpset -> simpExtLib.simpset
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Replaces all extension loopers, including split loopers, with one looper.

### Failure

Never fails.

### Example

``` hol4
>>_ val ext_bool_ss = simpExtLib.lift_simpset boolSimps.bool_ss;
>>_ val cases = simpExtLib.++ (ext_bool_ss,simpExtLib.split_ss);
>>_ val conjunctions = simpExtLib.set_looper
     ("conj", fn _ => CONJ_TAC) cases;
```

Only the conjunction looper remains in `conjunctions`.

### See also

[`simpExtLib.add_looper`](#simpExtLib.add_looper),
[`simpExtLib.del_looper`](#simpExtLib.del_looper).
